WEBVTT

00:00:00.350 --> 00:00:03.725
Your Part 2 answers run out early because you have practised

00:00:03.725 --> 00:00:04.737
too few cue cards.

00:00:05.738 --> 00:00:10.054
60 original Part 2 cue cards across six themes, each with a

00:00:10.054 --> 00:00:14.225
1-minute plan, a Band 7-style answer, and the same moment

00:00:14.225 --> 00:00:16.200
at Band 6 and Band 8 style.

00:00:17.222 --> 00:00:19.559
290,000 dong one-time.

00:00:19.559 --> 00:00:22.659
See the sample, or message Mr. Jay on Zalo.

